The FAQ is outdated.. When it was last updated (I think) when Compaq was 

the only ones making boards. When deskstation made the Ruffian (called

164RPX then) they had to make their own firmware for it. So it does not

have SRM, ARCBIOS, or AlphaBIOS - only ARCSBIOS. 

